From 8507553ba6f24be0d0833babf30a4fac2d2836d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: uuu <3100141307@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:36:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Reduce page-table cursor verification cost

Localize quantified invariant unfolding in cursor scans, jumps, and maps.
Isolate mapping disjointness and same-slot address preservation proofs in
separate solver contexts, and narrow the page-table invariant expansion
needed when restoring a parent continuation.

After rebasing onto upstream/main 90087275e, reduce OSTD rlimit from
1,193,093,450 to 1,011,602,095. The full CI-equivalent total is
1,087,033,549, 13.0% above the latest main baseline and below the 20%
performance alert threshold. Preserve cursor contracts and executable
behavior.

Validation: make; x86_64 full verification with --time-expanded;
make verify-riscv; make verify-loongarch; repeated make fmt;
git diff --check. The local regression module and incremental=false
configuration remain excluded from this commit.
---
